stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Alive

    Alive --> Downed : valid damage or monster down / budget available
    Alive --> Eliminated : revive budget exceeded or forced elimination
    Alive --> Escaped : TryEscape accepted by State Authority
    Alive --> Caught : TryCatchAuthoritative accepted (mode-dependent)

    Downed --> Downed : ReviveStarted / ReviveCancelled (same status)
    Downed --> Alive : CompleteReviveAuthoritative / kit consumed
    Downed --> Eliminated : bleedout or revive limit

    Caught --> Downed : catch timer expired / nonfatal
    Caught --> Eliminated : catch timer expired / fatal

    Eliminated --> [*]
    Escaped --> [*]

    note right of Downed
        Revive is a timed process while status remains Downed.
        Not a separate NetworkPlayerLifeStatus enum value.
    end note
    note right of Caught
        Shared life-state enum; capture behavior is mode-dependent.
        Do not imply every Expedition path uses Caught.
    end note
